      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "A landmark framework that made two-dimensional critical phenomena exactly tractable and reshaped statistical physics and quantum field theory.",
        "attribution": "The three credited authors jointly established the conformal field theory approach in their foundational work.",
        "maturity": "The theory has decades of mathematical development and broad, confirmed application.",
